Package: btrank
Title: Bradley-Terry Ranking Models for Paired Comparison Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Álvaro", "Meca", 
           email = "aalvaromecaa11@gmail.com", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits Bradley-Terry models to estimate latent ability scores
    from paired comparison data. Supports multiple metrics, temporal
    weighting via exponential decay, and win probability matrices.
    Designed for sports analytics, preference experiments, and any
    domain where items are compared pairwise over time.
